Build a complete, production-ready, responsive web application named:

“Topclues Solutions – Payroll & Salary Slip Management System”

Do not create only a visual prototype or static mockup. Generate a functional full-stack application with authentication, database, private file storage, salary calculations, PDF salary slips, email delivery, role-based access, historical payroll records, audit logs, validation, security rules, tests, and deployment instructions.

Use TypeScript throughout.

Recommended technology:

- Frontend: React with TypeScript
- Backend: secure Node.js server runtime or Firebase Cloud Functions
- Authentication: Firebase Authentication with Google Sign-In only
- Database: Cloud Firestore
- Private PDF storage: Cloud Storage for Firebase
- Hosting: Firebase Hosting, Firebase App Hosting, or Google AI Studio deployment
- PDF generation: server-side only
- Email delivery: backend email adapter using Firebase Trigger Email extension with SMTP, Gmail API, or another securely configured provider
- Secrets: Google Cloud Secret Manager or Firebase secret configuration
- Security: Firebase custom claims, Firestore Security Rules, Storage Security Rules, Firebase App Check and backend ID-token verification

The application must not use Gemini or any LLM to calculate salaries, determine permissions, or make payroll decisions. All payroll calculations must be deterministic TypeScript functions with automated tests.

